 "description": "Boulevard x diagonal avenue OPENING box (task orthfix, xsect 39): where a diagonal avenue leaves a boulevard through one side and the boulevard runs on, sc3netmod's BV block writes the avenue band's nine cells in the boulevard's rows as one paved box (crosswalks where the avenue leaves and across the boulevard on both sides, the boulevard's far kerb runs on). 22470..22478 the avenue going +x+z from the boulevard's +w side, 22479..22487 the mirror. Round 2026-11-15b (0.2.0, xsect 43): the same opening for a diagonal BOULEVARD, 12 cells (30209..30220, mirror 30221..30232, table lines bvo 2 / 3). Saved as 43. Needs boulevard, diagonal_avenue, diagonal_boulevard. Build: `py -3.12 -m netmod.bvdiag_build build .` in re/tools (art from the game's frames, not shipped).",
